{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13209210","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13209210","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1320921001:0":{"text":"怎么样，你们找到那个女幽灵了吗？","source_cn":"怎么样，你们找到那个女幽灵了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x927516E75324E65C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320921002:0":{"text":"找到啦！而且我们还答应帮她完成心愿，把她的坟墓从这里迁回雪松镇上！","source_cn":"找到啦！而且我们还答应帮她完成心愿，把她的坟墓从这里迁...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0F77A3A12E352F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320921003:1":{"text":"迁走坟墓？！这……","source_cn":"迁走坟墓？！这……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7102517FE4B20B51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1320921003":{"text":"迁走坟墓？！这……","source_cn":"迁走坟墓？！这……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7102517FE4B20B51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320921005:0":{"text":"唉，说实话吧。雪松镇的本地习俗就是把死者葬在一起，方便我们这些巡墓人监视，这样出现活死人的时候就能尽快将他们处理掉。","source_cn":"唉，说实话吧。雪松镇的本地习俗就是把死者葬在一起，方便...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDED9658295544B3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320921006:0":{"text":"至于镇上的教堂墓地，那周围有不少民居。为了防止那片墓地里的死者异变，那里只安葬修士和修女，还有那些受过女神祝福的人。这些人是不可能变成活死人的。","source_cn":"至于镇上的教堂墓地，那周围有不少民居。为了防止那片墓地...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6CE859AB8C1B6C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320921007:1":{"text":"这么说来，幽灵大婶就不能安葬在那边了……？","source_cn":"这么说来，幽灵大婶就不能安葬在那边了……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58BFF1BE09EEE155","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320921008:1":{"text":"巡墓人叔叔，就不能破例一次吗？幽灵大婶不是活死人，她只是一直牵挂着她死去的儿子……","source_cn":"巡墓人叔叔，就不能破例一次吗？幽灵大婶不是活死人，她只...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B9EFE5DABD939EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320921009:1":{"text":"恐怕不行，毕竟她是幽灵……","source_cn":"恐怕不行，毕竟她是幽灵……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C1266FE6B0E47C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1320921010:0":{"text":"……等等。既然她已经是幽灵，是不是就没可能再变成活死人了？","source_cn":"……等等。既然她已经是幽灵，是不是就没可能再变成活死人了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE36BA39DC9B987A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1320921011:0":{"text":"唔，从理论上来说是的。毕竟变成幽灵就代表灵魂已经彻底脱离身体了。","source_cn":"唔，从理论上来说是的。毕竟变成幽灵就代表灵魂已经彻底脱...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA69AC187BC223D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1320921012:1":{"text":"既然这样……那好吧，你们就把她的坟墓迁过去吧。","source_cn":"既然这样……那好吧，你们就把她的坟墓迁过去吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB63EEB4B3D416D8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1320921013:0":{"text":"你们知道她的名字吧？我得记录一下，免得后面又出什么问题。","source_cn":"你们知道她的名字吧？我得记录一下，免得后面又出什么问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48FB4B799D1890BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1320921014:0":{"text":"当然知道，幽灵大婶叫克谢尼娅！","source_cn":"当然知道，幽灵大婶叫克谢尼娅！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6EF51050970A5C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1320921015:1":{"text":"克谢尼娅……我记得这墓园里至少有三个人都叫这个名字。","source_cn":"克谢尼娅……我记得这墓园里至少有三个人都叫这个名字。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4CDD39A134BCD26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1320921016:0":{"text":"啊？！这、这我们要怎么确定哪个才是我们要找的人啊？！","source_cn":"啊？！这、这我们要怎么确定哪个才是我们要找的人啊？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE776113